# secret-scan allowlist — path regexes that are never reported.
#
# One extended regex per line, matched against the repo-relative path.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Only add an entry after opening the file and confirming the match is a
# placeholder or public test fixture. Prefer fixing the line: a real key moved
# to ~/.secrets.env is always better than an allowlist entry.
#
# Examples (commented out — they are NOT active):
# docs/examples/.*\.md$
# test/fixtures/.*\.json$
